From 2f3b7fe112d5b782e4beecd1307f82995f29e1d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Your Name <185855009@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 21:00:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: use user photo as reference for AI outfit image
 generation

Switch from text-to-image (wanx2.1-t2i-plus) to image-to-image (wanx-v1)
when generating outfit photos, so the result preserves the user's face,
hair, and body features instead of creating a generic person.

Changes:
- Add buildOutfitPrompt() back to openai-image.ts for text-to-image mode
- API route now accepts userImage and uses buildOutfitI2IPrompt when available
- Generate page passes imageDataUrl to the image generation API

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
